  "title": "Portuguese Steamed Clams",
  "description": "Being of Portuguese descent and raised in Rhode Island along the Eastern seaboard, this Portuguese clams recipe is a wonderful combination of my two heritages. If desired serve with a small cup of melted butter for dipping clams and don&#39;t forget a fresh loaf of warm, crusty bread!",
